wait 3
cra://debug?glyphs=FolderRowView,0
expect-log Cra glyphs FolderRowView,0: key "Login with SSO to unlock this folder"
cra://debug?glyphs=FolderRowView,1
expect-log Cra glyphs FolderRowView,1: exclamationmark.triangle "Sign back in to GitHub."
